concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Powers includes functions and duties"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears: (a) a reference to powers includes a reference to functions or duties; and (b) a reference to the exercise of powers includes a reference to the performance of functions or duties.   Australian Capital Territory  Part II  Section 7 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
    skos:definition "In this Act, unless the contrary intention appears: (a) a reference to powers includes a reference to functions or duties; and (b) a reference to the exercise of powers includes a reference to the performance of functions or duties.   Australian Capital Territory  Part II  Section 7 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3a6109eb6e81b46929ccaef7e8ee513928fffbf1b53783190ccafd96e245f07b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A reference to powers includes a reference to functions or duties." ;
