doc:sch-5-sec-14-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14(3) Disqualification of member" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Paragraph (1)(c) does not apply to a superannuation scheme: (a) that is established by or under an enactment; and (b) under which any or all of the following benefits are provided: (i) benefits for a person upon ceasing to hold an office of member;   Legislative Assembly  Part III Constitution of Assembly  Division 1 Section 15 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (ii) benefits for a person who is or was a member in the event of the permanent or temporary disability of the person; (iii) benefits for dependants of a person who is or was a member in the event of the death of the person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-14-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14(4) Disqualification of member"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-14-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In subsection (3): dependant has the same meaning as in the Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993." ;
