concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Conflict of interest"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A member of the Assembly who is a party to, or has a direct or indirect interest in, a contract made by or on behalf of the Territory or a Territory authority shall not take part in a discussion of a matter, or vote on a question, in a meeting of the Assembly where the matter or question relates directly or indirectly to that contract. (2) A question concerning the application of subsection (1) shall be decided by the Assembly, and a contravention of that subsection does not invalidate anything done by the Assembly." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A member of the Assembly who is a party to, or has a direct or indirect interest in, a contract made by or on behalf of the Territory or a Territory authority shall not take part in a discussion of a matter, or vote on a question, in a meeting of the Assembly where the matter or question relates directly or indirectly to that contract. (2) A question concerning the application of subsection (1) shall be decided by the Assembly, and a contravention of that subsection does not invalidate anything done by the Assembly."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "00174b8e53dd25d082d3cc7d88348c09bd8c3ac73778a49392bddd16f8ed4de1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-15-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-15-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.15" .
