concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Application of Acts Interpretation Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "Neither paragraph 46(1)(a) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 nor paragraph 13(1)(a) or (b) of the Legislation Act 2003 applies to: (a) an enactment;   Powers of Legislative Assembly  Part IV  Section 34 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) a subordinate law; or (c) an instrument required by this Act to be published in the Territory Gazette." ;
    skos:definition "Neither paragraph 46(1)(a) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 nor paragraph 13(1)(a) or (b) of the Legislation Act 2003 applies to: (a) an enactment;   Powers of Legislative Assembly  Part IV  Section 34 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (b) a subordinate law; or (c) an instrument required by this Act to be published in the Territory Gazette."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3d01956d14962b0c70ffd5595300c27c033f0804dcf0b98a4db9547fe7f12039" ;
