doc:sch-5-sec-38a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "38A Executive’s powers under Commonwealth Acts" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "An enactment may provide for the exercise by a member or members of the Executive of powers vested in the Executive by or under an Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-39 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "39 Membership of Executive"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-39 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The members of the Executive are the Chief Minister and such other Ministers as are appointed by the Chief Minister.   The Executive  Part V  Section 40 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (2) The exercise of the powers of the Executive is not affected merely because of a vacancy or vacancies in the membership of the Executive." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The members of the Executive are the Chief Minister and such other Ministers as are appointed by the Chief Minister.   The Executive  Part V  Section 40 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024 (2) The exercise of the powers of the Executive is not affected merely because of a vacancy or vacancies in the membership of the Executive."@en ;
