concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Chief Minister for the Territory"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "(1) At the first meeting of the Assembly after a general election, the members present shall, after electing a Presiding Officer and before any other business, elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister for the Territory. (2) If there is a vacancy in the office of Chief Minister (not because of a dissolution of the Assembly), then: (a) if the vacancy happens at a meeting, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister; or (b) if the vacancy happens at any other time, the Presiding Officer shall, by notice published in the Territory Gazette, convene a meeting as soon as practicable and, at the meeting, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister. (3) If a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister is passed, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(1) At the first meeting of the Assembly after a general election, the members present shall, after electing a Presiding Officer and before any other business, elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister for the Territory. (2) If there is a vacancy in the office of Chief Minister (not because of a dissolution of the Assembly), then: (a) if the vacancy happens at a meeting, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister; or (b) if the vacancy happens at any other time, the Presiding Officer shall, by notice published in the Territory Gazette, convene a meeting as soon as practicable and, at the meeting, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister. (3) If a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister is passed, the members present shall elect one of their number to be the Chief Minister."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ffab7b10a8cbe3b9bca6eae206fac0f5fdd607164e5754ad792ab62e86daf60b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-40-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-40-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-40-ss-3 ;
