concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-46 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46 Vacation of office by Ministers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-46 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person holding office as Chief Minister vacates the office: (a) when the person resigns the office; or (b) when the person ceases to be a member (not because of a general election); or (c) immediately before a Chief Minister is elected after: (i) the next general election; or (ii) the passing of a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister. (1A) A person holding office as a Minister (other than the Chief Minister) vacates the office: (a) when the person resigns the office; or (b) when the person ceases to be a member (not because of a general election); or (c) when the person is dismissed from office by the Chief Minister; or (d) immediately before another Chief Minister is elected after: (i) the next general election; or (ii) the passing of a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister. (2) A person who has vacated an office of Minister may be re-elected or re-appointed." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person holding office as Chief Minister vacates the office: (a) when the person resigns the office; or (b) when the person ceases to be a member (not because of a general election); or (c) immediately before a Chief Minister is elected after: (i) the next general election; or (ii) the passing of a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister. (1A) A person holding office as a Minister (other than the Chief Minister) vacates the office: (a) when the person resigns the office; or (b) when the person ceases to be a member (not because of a general election); or (c) when the person is dismissed from office by the Chief Minister; or (d) immediately before another Chief Minister is elected after: (i) the next general election; or (ii) the passing of a resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister. (2) A person who has vacated an office of Minister may be re-elected or re-appointed."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "04e37efe1906a24f71b3b293b4f4b9b34a865b47b87434a7596e27d7acef7b73" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-46-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-46-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-46-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.29" .
