doc:sch-5-sec-59-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "59(1) Financial relations between Commonwealth and Territory" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commonwealth shall conduct its financial relations with the Territory so as to ensure that the Territory is treated on the same basis as the States and the Northern Territory, while having regard to the special circumstances arising from the existence of the national capital and the seat of government of the Commonwealth in the Territory." ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59(2) Financial relations between Commonwealth and Territory"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-59-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Territory is not liable to bear the cost, or part of the cost, of: (a) any power of the Commonwealth relating to a matter referred to in section 23; (b) administering a law, or a provision of a law, referred to in Schedule 5; or (c) any other power of the Commonwealth, or of a Commonwealth authority, relating to the Territory.   Finance  Part VII  Section 60 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Territory is not liable to bear the cost, or part of the cost, of: (a) any power of the Commonwealth relating to a matter referred to in section 23; (b) administering a law, or a provision of a law, referred to in Schedule 5; or (c) any other power of the Commonwealth, or of a Commonwealth authority, relating to the Territory.   Finance  Part VII  Section 60 Australian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 Compilation date: 11/12/2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2e27442422f5b24ca3141fd0bdeb98d6657e4a1af578105878e1a82f0bcef5cb" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59 ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Territory is not liable to bear the cost of certain Commonwealth powers." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
