    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The members to be elected at a general election are to be elected as provided by sections 67, 67C and 67D and by an enactment that: (a) provides for general elections; and (b) complies with section 67B; and (c) was made after polling day for the second general election." ;
